A||||10||fiero56||surfing in my new chair||||10||
Z||000000||fiero56||10-27-2000||03:18 PM||||One of the many parts that I received with my new SE was a perfect complete solid grey speaker Fiero seat. Since I had no use for this seat, I turned it into a chair to use at the computer. I obtained an old office chair, removed the seat, and just used the stand and base. I then made my own adapter plate for the Fiero seat, bolted it up, and I am now sitting in it in front of the computer. Much more comfy than my old folding chair, plus all I need to do is find a receiver to hook up to the speakers in the chair, and I have stereo right at my ears while I surf. Plus it reclines. Just throwing an idea out if anyone else has a spare seat taking up space.<P>------------------<BR>       <IMG SRC="http://www.fiero.nl/uploads/pffsig1.jpg"> ||||reg||10
